; Vulkan renderer quality preset - DEFAULT
; The shipped balance: what the renderer's own defaults come out at, written
; down so the row can get BACK to it after an experiment.
; See rspec_vk_minimum.ltx for why these files exist and why the name is new.

r_render_scale 1.
r_aa_mode dlss_quality
r_dlss_preset 11
r_dlss_sharp 0.3

; *** SHADOWS. Was sixteen lines here; it is one now, and the one also
; reaches the entries the sixteen never did - r_vsm_tree_wind(_dist) (the
; radius inside which a crown is re-rasterised every frame instead of being
; read from the static cache: VSM/DynTrees was 4.20 of 8.57 ms on a 780M),
; r_vsm_cadence, r_vsm_base and the r_vsm_throttle budget.
; One authority on purpose: the shadow row of the options screen DERIVES
; which tier is on from these values, so a preset that set half of them by
; hand would leave that row reading "Custom" right after a fresh pick.
r_shadows High
r_sun_grass_dist 30.

r_ssao 1
r2_ssao st_opt_medium
r_ssao_strength 2.
r_ssao_temporal 0.85
r_ssil 1
r_ssil_strength 0.5
r_spec_occ 1.
r_ibl 0
r_sky_sh 1

; *** GI CHAIN. No preset ever touched it - and on a GPU with no ray-tracing
; headroom it is the single most expensive line in the file. Measured on a
; Radeon 780M (pripyat_full, 2560x1600): Gather 6.62 + DDGI 2.21 + WRC 0.46
; = 9.3 ms out of a 75 ms frame, and the presets could not reach any of it.
; Why the line was missing: r_ddgi / r_gather / r_wrc are NoSave cvars, so
; they never appear in a saved config and nobody thought to put them here.
; The r_gi COMMAND gets around that - cfg_load runs it like any console line.
; off = tear the producers down | 1 probes | 2 + final gather | 3 + world cache
; 3, NOT 2 (06-09-2026). Below 3 the world cache is off, nothing MEASURES sky
; occlusion, and the receiver re-applies the baked lightmap on the probe answer
; ("baked mult 1.00" in the [VK GI] line). An interior lightmap is black, so
; every room read as "outside bright, inside black, no light through the
; windows" - the whole interior chain (skyvis, sky_field, field clamps) only
; exists at 3. The cache is the cheap rung: 0.46 of the chain's 9.3 ms (780M).
r_gi 3

; Draw distance. far_plane_render = the weather far_plane (~400 m) TIMES this.
; The 8.0 default was measured free on a 4070-class laptop; on a weak GPU in
; forest it is the VSM caster set, the cull walk and the HZB, and it is not.
rs_vis_distance 4.

r_light_cones 1
r_light_cone_density 1.2
r_flashlight_glow 2.

r_vol 0
r_vol_intensity 3.
r_vol_ms 3
r_vol_ta 1
r_vol_upsample 1
r_vol_mist 0.
r_vol_smoke 1.
r_vol_smoke_shadow 1.
r_clouds 1
r_clouds_steps 48
r_rain 1

r_tree_dist 250.
r_tree_hzb 1
r_tree_shade_dist 100.
r__detail_density 0.6
r__detail_radius 100
r__detail_scale 1.
r_grass_aref 0.33
r_wind_tree_bend 0.18
r_hzb_cull 1
r_vrs 0

r_pom 1
r_pom_steps 24.
r_pom_terrain 0
r_bump 1.
r_terrain_detail_dist 120.
r_wet_dist 200.
r_wet_refl 0.6
r_puddle_level 0.5
r_snow_deform 1

r_wtr 1
r_wtr_tess 64.
r_wtr_refl 1.
r_wtr_caustic 0.55
r_wtr_sim 1

r_dither 1.
r_txstream 1
r_gpu_particles 0
